    "northStar": "The Graphite Dispatch Desk",
    "overview": "This document records the public passenger addition only; the root DESIGN.md remains the authority for the inherited Vivat world. The anonymous Ukrainian booking surface uses the same practical sans-serif hierarchy, graphite tonal layers, rounded containment, and gold identity. Its Operate mode makes route selection and checkout easy to scan.",
